<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8">
	</head>
	<body>
		Someone asked to register a REON account with this email address, but one already exists.<br>
		<br>
		You don't need to sign up again &mdash; just log in at
		<a href="https://{{ hostname }}/login.php">https://{{ hostname }}/login.php</a>.<br>
		<br>
		If you don't remember your password, use the link below to choose a new one.<br>
		The link is valid for 24 hours or until another one is generated.<br>
		<br>
		If you did not initiate this, please ignore this email. Your account has not been changed.<br>
		<br>
		Link: <a href="https://{{ hostname }}/reset_password.php?id={{ id }}&amp;key={{ key }}">https://{{ hostname }}/reset_password.php?id={{ id }}&amp;key={{ key }}</a>
	</body>
</html>
